  "rationale": "The claim consists of two parts: that American forces fought in the Battle of Saipan and that they fought in the Battle of Manila. The first evidence finding confirms that American forces (specifically the U.S. 2nd Marine Division, 4th Marine Division, and 27th Infantry Division) launched an amphibious assault during the Battle of Saipan. The second evidence finding confirms that American forces were involved in the Battle of Manila, specifically noting the battles of 1899 and 1945, with the 1945 battle being fought by forces from the United States and the Philippines against Japanese troops. Since both parts of the claim are supported by the provided evidence, the claim is supported.",
  "sources": [
    "Battle of Saipan\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Saipan",
    "Battle of Manila (1945)\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Manila_(1945)"
  ]
}

